  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4902.07 “State fire marshal” means the state fire marshal of the state of New Hampshire or his designee.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06; ss by #9766-A, eff 3-3-10 (formerly Saf-C 4902.08)",
